{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Sarek_opencl.Opencl_api</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"sarek-opencl","href":"../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Sarek_opencl","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Opencl_api","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[{"title":"Exceptions","href":"#exceptions","children":[]},{"title":"Platform Management","href":"#platform-management","children":[]},{"title":"Device Management","href":"#device-management","children":[]},{"title":"Context Management","href":"#context-management","children":[]},{"title":"Command Queue Management","href":"#command-queue-management","children":[]},{"title":"Memory Management","href":"#memory-management","children":[]},{"title":"Program Management","href":"#program-management","children":[]},{"title":"Kernel Management","href":"#kernel-management","children":[]},{"title":"Utility Functions","href":"#utility-functions","children":[]}],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"","content":"<h2 id=\"exceptions\"><a href=\"#exceptions\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Exceptions</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec exception anchored\" id=\"exception-Opencl_error\"><a href=\"#exception-Opencl_error\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">exception</span> </span><span><span class=\"exception\">Opencl_error</span> <span class=\"keyword\">of</span> <a href=\"../Opencl_types/index.html#type-cl_error\">Opencl_types.cl_error</a> * string</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Deprecated: no longer raised. <code>check</code> below now raises the canonical <a href=\"../Opencl_error/index.html#exception-Opencl_error\"><code>Opencl_error.Opencl_error</code></a> (a <code>Backend_error</code> alias) via the shared <a href=\"../../../spoc/Sarek_backend_error/Backend_error/Make/index.html#val-check\"><code>Sarek_backend_error.Backend_error.Make.check</code></a> funnel. Kept only so out-of-tree code matching on <code>Opencl_api.Opencl_error (code, ctx)</code> still compiles (this library is opam-published).</p><ul class=\"at-tags\"><li class=\"deprecated\"><span class=\"at-tag\">deprecated</span> no longer raised; Opencl_api.check now raises Opencl_error.Opencl_error (Backend_error) - catch that instead</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-check\"><a href=\"#val-check\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> check : <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>int32 <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Check OpenCL result and raise a canonical <code>Backend_error</code> on failure.</p></div></div><h2 id=\"platform-management\"><a href=\"#platform-management\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Platform Management</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Platform\"><a href=\"#module-Platform\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"Platform/index.html\">Platform</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div></div><h2 id=\"device-management\"><a href=\"#device-management\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Device Management</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Device\"><a href=\"#module-Device\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"Device/index.html\">Device</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div></div><h2 id=\"context-management\"><a href=\"#context-management\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Context Management</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Context\"><a href=\"#module-Context\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"Context/index.html\">Context</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div></div><h2 id=\"command-queue-management\"><a href=\"#command-queue-management\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Command Queue Management</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-CommandQueue\"><a href=\"#module-CommandQueue\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"CommandQueue/index.html\">CommandQueue</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div></div><h2 id=\"memory-management\"><a href=\"#memory-management\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Memory Management</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Memory\"><a href=\"#module-Memory\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"Memory/index.html\">Memory</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div></div><h2 id=\"program-management\"><a href=\"#program-management\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Program Management</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Program\"><a href=\"#module-Program\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"Program/index.html\">Program</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div></div><h2 id=\"kernel-management\"><a href=\"#kernel-management\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Kernel Management</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Kernel\"><a href=\"#module-Kernel\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"Kernel/index.html\">Kernel</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div></div><h2 id=\"utility-functions\"><a href=\"#utility-functions\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Utility Functions</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-is_available\"><a href=\"#val-is_available\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> is_available : <span>unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-String\"><a href=\"#module-String\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> <a href=\"String/index.html\">String</a></span><span> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span></span></code></div></div>"}